   <section class="section-spacing whypartner-section relative overflow-hidden" aria-labelledby="whypartner-heading">
      <div class="bgimage-outer-wrap" aria-hidden="true">
         <img src="~/Assets/images/bg-image-dark.webp" alt="" class="w-full h-full object-cover bg-image">
      </div>
      <div class="container relative z-1">
         <div class="section-title-outer section-title-outer-start solutions-faq-heading">
            <h2 class="text-h2 title-section reveal-text">
               Why partner with <span>Priya Cement?</span>
            </h2>
         </div>

         <div class="whypartner-grid">
            <article class="whypartner-card">
               <div class="whypartner-card-head">
                  <h3 class="whypartner-card-title">A trusted brand</h3>
                  <span class="whypartner-card-num text-ghost text-big leading-none font-bold" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
               </div>
               <p>Backed by four decades of quality and reliability across South India, with a strong reputation builders and homeowners already recognise.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="whypartner-card">
               <div class="whypartner-card-head">
                  <h3 class="whypartner-card-title">End-to-end business support</h3>
                  <span class="whypartner-card-num text-ghost text-big leading-none font-bold" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
               </div>
               <p>Guidance from planning and store setup through launch, day-to-day operations, and managing customer deliveries with confidence.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="whypartner-card">
               <div class="whypartner-card-head">
                  <h3 class="whypartner-card-title">Exclusive business opportunity</h3>
                  <span class="whypartner-card-num text-ghost text-big leading-none font-bold" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
               </div>
               <p>Operate as a dedicated Priya Cement partner and build a focused local presence in your market with an exclusive store model.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="whypartner-card">
               <div class="whypartner-card-head">
                  <h3 class="whypartner-card-title">Product and business training</h3>
                  <span class="whypartner-card-num text-ghost text-big leading-none font-bold" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
               </div>
               <p>Structured training covering product knowledge, customer engagement, sales skills, and practical business management.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="whypartner-card">
               <div class="whypartner-card-head">
                  <h3 class="whypartner-card-title">Marketing and brand support</h3>
                  <span class="whypartner-card-num text-ghost text-big leading-none font-bold" aria-hidden="true">05</span>
               </div>
               <p>Local and regional marketing initiatives that help you build awareness and drive footfall to your store.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="whypartner-card">
               <div class="whypartner-card-head">
                  <h3 class="whypartner-card-title">On-site technical support</h3>
                  <span class="whypartner-card-num text-ghost text-big leading-none font-bold" aria-hidden="true">06</span>
               </div>
               <p>Technical vehicles and field support to assist with site conversion, product guidance, and local promotion.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="whypartner-card">
               <div class="whypartner-card-head">
                  <h3 class="whypartner-card-title">Technology support</h3>
                  <span class="whypartner-card-num text-ghost text-big leading-none font-bold" aria-hidden="true">07</span>
               </div>
               <p>Digital tools and systems designed to help you manage inventory, orders, and day-to-day business efficiently.</p>
            </article>
