               Frequently Asked <span>Questions</span>
            </h2>
         </div>

         <div class="solutions-faq-list" data-solutions-faq>
            
            <div class="solutions-faq-item is-open">
               <button type="button" class="solutions-faq-trigger" aria-expanded="true">
                  <span class="solutions-faq-q">Will Priya Cement help me set up the business?</span>
                  <span class="solutions-faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
               </button>
               <div class="solutions-faq-panel" role="region">
                  <div class="solutions-faq-panel-inner">
                     <p>Yes. Our team will guide eligible applicants through the evaluation and onboarding process and provide support for store development and business activation.</p>
                  </div>
               </div>
            </div>

            <div class="solutions-faq-item">
               <button type="button" class="solutions-faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
                  <span class="solutions-faq-q">Is this opportunity available for women entrepreneurs?</span>
                  <span class="solutions-faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
               </button>
               <div class="solutions-faq-panel" role="region">
                  <div class="solutions-faq-panel-inner">
                     <p>Yes. Priya Cement Customer Solutions welcomes applications from women entrepreneurs who meet the eligibility criteria for the location and investment requirements.</p>
                  </div>
               </div>
            </div>

            <div class="solutions-faq-item">
               <button type="button" class="solutions-faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
                  <span class="solutions-faq-q">What kind of support will I receive to set up Priya Cement Customer Solutions store?</span>
                  <span class="solutions-faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
               </button>
               <div class="solutions-faq-panel" role="region">
                  <div class="solutions-faq-panel-inner">
                     <p>Support typically includes guidance on store setup and branding, product assortment, training, and ongoing business activation so you can serve customers confidently from day one.</p>
                  </div>
               </div>
            </div>

            <div class="solutions-faq-item">
               <button type="button" class="solutions-faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
                  <span class="solutions-faq-q">Can I apply for the Priya Cement Customer Solutions store if I am already running another business?</span>
                  <span class="solutions-faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
               </button>
               <div class="solutions-faq-panel" role="region">
                  <div class="solutions-faq-panel-inner">
                     <p>Yes, you can apply if you already run another business. Eligibility depends on location, investment readiness, and alignment with the Customer Solutions store model.</p>
                  </div>
               </div>
            </div>

            <div class="solutions-faq-item">
               <button type="button" class="solutions-faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
                  <span class="solutions-faq-q">Will Priya Cement contact me after I submit my details?</span>
                  <span class="solutions-faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
               </button>
               <div class="solutions-faq-panel" role="region">
                  <div class="solutions-faq-panel-inner">
                     <p>Yes. After you submit the enquiry form, our team will review your details and get in touch with next steps if the opportunity is a fit for your location.</p>
                  </div>
               </div>
            </div>

            <div class="solutions-faq-item">
               <button type="button" class="solutions-faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
                  <span class="solutions-faq-q">Are opportunities available in all locations?</span>
                  <span class="solutions-faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
               </button>
               <div class="solutions-faq-panel" role="region">
                  <div class="solutions-faq-panel-inner">
                     <p>Opportunities depend on market potential and existing coverage. Share your preferred location in the enquiry form and we will confirm availability for that area.</p>
                  </div>
               </div>
            </div>

            <div class="solutions-faq-item">
               <button type="button" class="solutions-faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
                  <span class="solutions-faq-q">What happens after I submit the enquiry form?</span>
                  <span class="solutions-faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
               </button>
               <div class="solutions-faq-panel" role="region">
                  <div class="solutions-faq-panel-inner">
                     <p>Our team reviews your submission, may reach out for a short discussion, and then shares the evaluation and onboarding steps if you are shortlisted for a store opportunity.</p>
                  </div>
               </div>
            </div>

         </div>
      </div>
   </section>
   


